 {:name "fib-gherkin"
- :version "0.1.0"
+ :version "0.1.1"

Acceptance in fib-gherkin (a spec under specs/, run by `fibc test`): a program that calls `(run-into "features/*.feature" (steps)
["--only" ID "--format" "json"] sink)` with a sink that appends to a buffer reads the fib.test JSON of that one scenario from the buffer,
nothing on standard output; the same with `--messages` reads the message stream from the buffer. The existing specs stay green: nothing
of `fibc test`'s path changes. Requires a fibber whose lib/fib/test/run.fib has `run-main-into` (the release that carries LT1).
